## Ignore Visual Studio temp files, build results, and user-specific files

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userprev
*.userprefs
*.dbmdl
*.jfm

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Re]leases/
x64/
x86/
build/
bin/
obj/

# Visual Studio 2015/2017/2019/2022 cache/options directory
.vs/

# Database backups or auto-generated database files
DB-Backup/
*.bak
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.sdf

# NuGet Packages
packages/
